5,1,1,talk,Shion,,We need a logical decision. I'll look into the partition wall to the office and crumbs and bins at the desks.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think we should check the costs. I'll look at invoices for outside hire by the hour and quotes for the two fit-outs.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know who actually uses it! I'll check the fortnight's tally of use by person and the final clear-out of the old fridge.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Servas,,A room is more than its walls. I shall look into unplanned talk since the refit and where the last awkward conversation happened.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,Efficiency is key. I will investigate facilities callouts on this floor and the round trip for a hot lunch.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
