25,2,,status,Daisuke,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
26,2,,status,Toshio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
27,2,,status,Shion,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
28,2,,status,Rin,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
29,2,,status,Servas,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
30,2,1,talk,Shion,,"The wall is practically transparent to sound, and people are eating at their desks, leaving a mess. We can't have a noisy room.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"We've spent 68,000 yen on outside rentals for tiny groups. A meeting fit-out is 141,000, while a kitchen is 96,000.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,1,talk,Rin,,Only two people use the room most of the time! And one person always ends up cleaning the fridge alone.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,1,talk,Servas,,"We have no place for private, difficult talks; the last one happened in front of everyone. We are becoming strangers.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"Most of us spend twenty-five minutes just getting hot lunch. Facilities callouts are low, so maintenance isn't the main issue.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,2,talk,Shion,,"@Daisuke, if we are paying for outside rooms, a Meeting Space seems logical, but the sound leakage is a problem.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shion, you're right. But if we make it a Quiet Room, we might still need to pay for outside meetings.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,2,talk,Rin,,Why have a kitchen if only two people use the room? It seems like a waste of space!,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Rin, perhaps they use it because it is the only place to escape. We need a space for human connection.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,2,talk,Toshio,,A kitchen would save us hours of walking every week. That is a significant recovery of lost time.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,3,talk,Shion,,"A Quiet Room solves the noise and the desk-crumb issue, but it doesn't solve the meeting cost.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,"I'm worried about the budget. The kitchen is cheaper to install, but the meeting space saves the hourly hire fees.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,3,talk,Rin,,I just don't want one person doing all the cleaning again. Who will take care of it?,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,3,talk,Servas,,"A Meeting Space could be used for those awkward conversations, provided we fix the privacy.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,3,talk,Toshio,,The time spent on lunch trips is a systemic waste. An Open Kitchen is the most pragmatic choice for productivity.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,4,talk,Shion,,"If it's a kitchen, the smell and noise will just drift into the office through that thin wall.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think we should consider what we actually need most. The outside hire is quite expensive.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,4,talk,Rin,,I'll vote for whatever means we don't have to fight over who cleans up!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,4,talk,Servas,,We must prioritize our relationship as a team. A place to talk is essential.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,4,talk,Toshio,,Logic dictates we reduce the daily time waste. The kitchen is the most efficient use of the floor.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,3,,status,Daisuke,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
51,3,,status,Toshio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
