55,3,1,talk,Shion,,"The options are Open Kitchen, Meeting Space, or Quiet Room. I lean toward Quiet Room to stop the office chaos.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I think Meeting Space makes the most sense financially in the long run, despite the initial cost.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,1,talk,Rin,,I don't like the kitchen if it means more cleaning fights. I'll go with Meeting Space.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,1,talk,Servas,,A Meeting Space allows for the necessary conversations we've been avoiding. I support that.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"I still maintain the Open Kitchen is the best for time management, but I see the consensus shifting.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,2,talk,Shion,,"@Toshio, the kitchen doesn't solve the privacy issue Servas mentioned.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Shion, a Meeting Space is better than a Quiet Room if we want to stop paying those outside invoices.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,2,talk,Rin,,"Yeah! And a calendar for the Meeting Space means no more ""first come, first served"" fighting.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,2,talk,Servas,,"Exactly, Rin. Structure brings peace.","{""words"":5,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"If the goal is to stop outside spending and improve communication, the Meeting Space is the logical compromise.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,3,talk,Shion,,I suppose a Meeting Space is better than a kitchen if we can manage the noise.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I feel more comfortable with that. It's a clear investment.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,3,talk,Rin,,I'm happy with that!,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,3,talk,Servas,,It is a step toward becoming more than just strangers.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I will concede. The Meeting Space addresses the most concerns.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
